	source S1909 {
		title.value deed 15251005 de Zuchareta Liberalis
		author nodaro Padova Livio
		note {
			text """
Verbatim text: 1525 Indict[ione] XIIJ Die Jovis quinto m[ens]is oct[obris] Tar[vis]ij
sub volta palatij ad banchu[m] statij? ser Jo[anni] mathei
zibeti not[ar]ii : p[rese]ntib[us] ip[s]o ser Jo[anni] matheo zibeto not[ari]o
tar[visi]no, ac franc[isc]o trivisano d[e] scandolaria
q[uondam] ant[on]i habit[ator] in villa tivironj t[es]tib[us] vocatis
et alijs : Ibiq[ue] ser liberalis d[e] zuchareta not[ariu]s
civis tarvisinus q[uondam] egregij not[ar]ij ser Mathei d[e]
zuchareta ?iens no[m]i[n]e suo p[ro]prio et iure
et no[m]i[n]e honeste domine zanobie r[elic]te d[omini]ci
q[uondam] ser Mathei patris ip[s]ius ser liberalis eiusdeq[ue]
noverce absent[is] a qua dixit habere
man[da]tu[m], et p[ro]misitq[ue] q[uod] ip[s]a laudabit, et
ratificabit et : Titulo no[m]i[n]e, et ex cau[s]a
locatio[n]is durature annis nove[m] p[ro]x[ime] fut[uris] incept[e]
ad festu[m] s[anc]ti petri d[e] mense junij p[ro]x[ime] fut[uris]
locavit, et ad affictu[m] dedit p[er] se, et
suos h[e]r[e]des una[m] ip[s]ius d[omin]e zanubie possessio[n]em
arat[am], plant[atam], et vitigat[am], et parti[m] prativa
posit[a] et iacent[e] in villa d[e] villa campor[um]
trigintasex in plurib[us] pecijs in[fra] suos c[on]fines
vendramino q[uondam] luciani severini d[e] d[i]c[t]a
villa ville ibi p[rese]nti recip[ien]ti et c[on]ducenti p[ro] se
et fratrib[us] suis absentib[us] p[ro] quib[us] d[e] rato et
nec no[n] h[e]r[e]dib[us] suis p[ro] cuius responsione
\
et affictus dictus vendraminus suo, et
fratru[m] no[m]i[n]e renu[n]tians et[iam] p[ro]misit dare
et solvere omni anno annuati[m] staria tres
deci[m] fru[men]ti boni mu[n]di, sicci, et bene
cribelati c[on]duct[is] tar[visij] sup[ra] granario ip[s]ius
locat[or] o[mn]ib[us] suis exp[ens]is ip[s]ius c[on]duct[or] hoc
declarato q[uo] in p[rim]o anno d[i]c[t]i coloni no[n] tene=
ant[ur] solvere p[ro] affictu nisi st[ara] duod[e]ci[m], et
transato d[i]c[t]o p[rim]o anno st[ara] 13 ut sup[r]a in anno
et ratio[n]e annj, et medietate[m] vini nasituri
sup[ra] ip[s]a possessio[n]e fulati, et turculati c[on]duct[is]
tar[visij] omnib[us] suis periculis solvendo t[am]e[n] ip[s]e
locator datiu[m] imboriture?, et p[ro] onora[n]tijs
ad festu[m] s[anc]ti petri par unu[m] pullor[um], ad
festu[m] omniu[m] s[anc]tor[um] una[m] ancha[m], ad carnis
priviu[m] par unu[m] galinar[um], ad natalicia
unu[m] p[er]sutu[m] justi ponderis, et ad festa
resurecionis D[omi]ni n[ost]ri Jesu C[hristi] galina[m] una[m]
cu[m] ovis vigintiquinq[ue] omnib[us] c[on]ducendis
et solvendis temporib[us] debitis : declara[n]do
insup[er] q[uo] ip[s]e locator in se reservavit
curtivu[m] cu[m] broilo usq[ue] ad colu[m]bariam
existant in ip[s]o curtivo : et p[ro] residuo
\
d[i]c[t]i broili dictus c[on]ductor p[er] se et suos h[e]r[e]des
renu[n]cians dare, et solvere p[ro]misit omni
anno annuati[m] usq[ue] ad comple[m]entu[m] locationis
p[rese]ntis libras trigintas duas ?oltre[m]? p[ro] solve[n]dis
omni anno ad festu[m] s[anc]ti martinij quolib[et] anno
quam possess[ione] dictus c[on]ductor p[ro]misit bene
et diligent[e] arare, t[er]razare, fossadare
letamare plantare, et vitigare solve[n]do
tame[n] patronu[m] plantatos et viticellas, et
ip[s]e c[on]ductor teneat[ur] ire ad accipiendu[m]
plantatos viticellus, nec no[n] scalenos? p[ro] usu
d[i]c[t]e possessionis : potiusq[ue] meliorare q[uam] de=
teriorare, et p[re]fatus d[omino] locator p[ro]misit
locatio[n]es ip[s]am manutenere d[e] jure tantu[m]
usq[ue] ad complementu[m] d[i]c[t]or[um] annor[um] nove[m]
pattoq[ue] addito int[er] ip[s]as p[rese]ntes stipulat[or] firmato
q[uo] in omni casu q[uo] dictus d[omino] locator, v[e]l p[re]fata
d[omina] zanubia eius novercha vellet fabri=
chare in curtivo d[i]c[t]e possessionis q[uo] eo tunc
colonus ip[s]e teneat[ur] ad ire accipiendu[m] calce[m]?
ac dare omnia carigia? necessaria p[ro] fa=
brichando in ip[s]o curtivo, du[n]mo[do] dictus
d[omino] locator velet ip[su]m curtivu[m] ad affictu[m]
dare ip[s]i c[on]ductore et q[ue] o[mn]ia partes p[ro]misseru[n]t
menutenere et sub oblig[atione] o[m]ni[u]m suor[um] bonor[um] p[re]se[n]t[ium] et fut[urorum]"""
			audit.creation.date 5 JUL 2026 10:24:01
		}
		repository.repository R2
		note {
			text busta 550, carta 22
			audit.creation.date 2026-08-31T00:00:00Z
		}
