		publisher The West Australian (Perth, WA : 1879 - 1954)
		note {
			text """
Verbatim text: https://trove.nla.gov.au/newspaper/article/49060359

PESCE (Girolamo): Passed away Oct. 13, 1952, at Scorze, Venezia, Italy, dearly beloved husband of Maria, loved father of Lina, Alfonso, Emidio, Assunta, father-in-law of Luigi Biasin and Gelsomino Trevisan, grandfather of Gabriella Biasin: aged 58 years.
R.I.P."""
